0 Orbit Mixer — two-motor planetary mixing head
0 Name: orbit-mixer.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under the BSD-3-Clause license; see ../licenses/orbit-mixer.txt.
0 // Original native arrangement. Two motors: A carrier drive, B sun.
0 // 20T drives inverted 60T turntable; 40T sun meshes with 24T planet at 80 LDU.
0 // Common world-axis angular changes from the saved pose satisfy P = (8 C - 5 S) / 3.
0 // Tooth-clocked saved pose: carrier +3 deg and planet +15.5 deg about LDraw +Y.
0 // Connect motor cables to hub ports A and B. External part meshes are not embedded.
